{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26976","headline":"谢汾州田大夫寄茸毡[葡]萄 · 姚合","name":"谢汾州田大夫寄茸毡[葡]萄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"筐封紫[葡]萄，筒卷白茸毛。\n卧煖身应健，含消齿免劳。\n衾衣疎不称，梨栗鄙难高。\n晓起题诗报，寒澌满笔毫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26976.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26976","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}